 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(5\\cdot 2-0\\cdot (-1))i-((-3)\\cdot 2-0\\cdot 4)j+((-3)\\cdot (-1)-5\\cdot 4)k \\\\  & =10i+6j-17k \\\\  & =⟨10,6,-17⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{10}^{2}+{6}^{2}+(-17)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{100+36+289} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{425} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{17}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307198 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307199 13194139534745 true] [17592186307198 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307200 13194139534745 true] [17592186307198 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534745 true] [17592186307198 1041 "field-1" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307198 1104 #edb/ref 17592186307199 13194139534745 true] [17592186307198 1110 #uuid "943d052b-f729-5c2a-b57b-9744ee05fffd" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307199 1034 "5\\sqrt{17}" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307199 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534745 true] [17592186307199 1111 #uuid "11902f40-460a-54f5-ba02-3fcc03bf928d" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307200 1034 "425" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307200 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534745 true] [17592186307200 1111 #uuid "c1fa1e7c-e0e2-5a3a-9a9c-162f9105c39b" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307201 1017 #edb/ref 17592186307202 13194139534745 true] [17592186307201 1089 "q-316355" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307201 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534745 true] [17592186307201 1100 "Calculate the area ${A}_{△}$ of the triangle spanned by $p=⟨0,5,-1⟩$ and $q=⟨6,0,1⟩.$\n\n${A}_{△}=${{field-1}}" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307201 1113 #uuid "ec8f22dc-8840-55ee-9227-a4bca5d5e953" 13194139534745 true] [17592186307201 1145 "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p\\times q & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{alig